---
import Container from "@layouts/Container.astro";
import HorizontalBar from "@components/shared/HorizontalBar.astro";
---

<section class="py-12">
  <Container>
    <h2>A technology partner you can rely on</h2>
    <HorizontalBar />

    <div class="mt-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 w-full">
      <div class="grid gap-4">
        <p>
          Sulery Ventures is a Lagos-based technology solutions business helping
          individuals, homes, businesses and institutions solve their
          technology, security and connectivity needs. From computer sales and
          repairs to CCTV surveillance, networking, access control and intercom
          systems, we provide practical solutions designed around the way our
          customers actually live and work.
        </p>

        <p>
          Technology should make things easier, safer and more connected. But
          when the right equipment is not properly selected, installed or
          configured, it can quickly become a source of frustration.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Sulery Ventures, our approach is simple: understand what you need,
          recommend a solution that makes sense, and make sure it is properly
          set up and working as it should.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4">
        <p>
          Whether it is helping an individual get their computer back in working
          order, setting up a reliable network for a business, installing CCTV
          around a property, or putting an access control or intercom system in
          place, we focus on providing solutions that are practical, dependable
          and suited to the environment.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our work covers a range of technology and security needs. We supply
          and repair computers and accessories, install and configure CCTV
          systems, set up wired and wireless networks, install access control
          systems and provide intercom solutions for homes, offices, schools and
          other environments.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every project is different. That's why we take the time to understand
          the space, the people using it and what the system needs to achieve
          before recommending an approach.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-6" />

    <p>
      Have a project in mind? <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-3 py-2 bg-black text-white border border-black hover:bg-light-accent hover:text-black transition-all duration-300"
        >Contact us</a
      >
    </p>
  </Container>
</section>
